nvited to remain in Canberra after the upcoming sitting week for a three-hour, closed-door debate on energy policy, including net zero by 2050.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2025/oct/20/coalition-net-zero-policy-speculation-more-could-quit-sussan-ley\">Continue reading...</a>\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:0:{}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}}s:8:\"category\";a:12:{i:0;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:9:\"Coalition\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:6:\"domain\";s:52:\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/coalition\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:1;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:14:\"National party\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:6:\"domain\";s:57:\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/national-party\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:13:\"Liberal party\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:6:\"domain\";s:56:\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/liberal-party\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:14:\"Australia news\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:6:\"domain\";s:57:\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/australia-news\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:19:\"Australian politics\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:6:\"domain\";s:62:\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/australian-politics\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:10:\"Sussan Ley\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s:6:\"domain\";s:53:\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/sussan-ley\";}}s:8:\"xml_base\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"xml_base_explicit\";b:0;s:8:\"xml_lang\";s:0:\"\";}i:6;a:5:{s:4:\"data\";s:13:\"Barnaby Joyce\";s:7:\"attribs\";a:1:{s:0:\"\";a:1:{s