 src=\"http://172.19.125.111:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/priscilla-du-preez-XkKCui44iM0-unsplash.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-455 size-full\"/></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"twentytwentyfive\"} /-->','Front Page','Displays your site\'s home page, whether it is set to display latest posts or a static page. The Front Page template takes precedence over all templates.','inherit','closed','closed','','510-revision-v1','','','2025-10-14 12:26:16','2025-10-14 01:26:16','',510,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?p=643',0,'revision','',0),(644,1,'2025-10-14 12:27:02','2025-10-14 01:27:02','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Come and learn about preparndess</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Carers Info Session','','inherit','closed','closed','','642-revision-v1','','','2025-10-14 12:27:02','2025-10-14 01:27:02','',642,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?p=644',0,'revision','',0),(645,1,'2025-10-14 12:27:55','2025-10-14 01:27:55','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SATURDAY 11 OCTOBER 10.30am<br>COME ALONG TO THE U3A DISASTER PREPAREDNESS PRESENTATION.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Come along and hear guest speaker Kathryn Maxwell, President of SHASA (Southcoast Health &amp; Sustainability Alliance) share inspiring insights into SHASA’s work helping Eurobodalla transition to a low-carbon future, improve disaster preparedness, and strengthen community resilience.<br>Hear more about the development of the eight Bushfire and Heat Havens across the Eurobodalla.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kathryn will be outlining the new Eurobodalla Preparedness Guide which will be posted out to households in the Eurobodalla Shire in mid November.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tricia Pye from The Tec Exec will be discussing digital applications ( apps ) that you need to have installed on your devices for emergencies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TheTecExec?__tn__=-]K*F\">The Tec Exec</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/shasa.energy?__tn__=-]K*F\">Southcoast Health &amp; Sustainability Alliance</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>See less</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','U3A disaster Prepardness Presentation','','publish','open','open','','u3a-disaster-prepardness-presentation','','','2025-10-21 12:57:26','2025-10-21 01:57:26','',0,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?post_type=album&#038;p=645',0,'album','',0),(646,1,'2025-10-14 12:31:43','2025-10-14 01:31:43','Get in the know, get connected, get organised, get packing!\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nGuest speakers:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Kathryn Maxwell - SHASA President</li>\r\n 	<li>Von Hutcheson - Anglicare</li>\r\n</ul>','Tuross Head Community Gardens Disaster Preparedness Presentation','','publish','closed','closed','','tuross-head-community-gardens-disaster-preparedness-presentation','','','2025-10-14 13:24:12','2025-10-14 02:24:12','',0,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?post_type=em_event&#038;p=646',0,'em_event','',0),(647,1,'2025-10-14 12:27:55','2025-10-14 01:27:55','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SATURDAY 11 OCTOBER 10.30am<br>COME ALONG TO THE U3A DISASTER PREPAREDNESS PRESENTATION.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Come along and hear guest speaker Kathryn Maxwell, President of SHASA (Southcoast Health &amp; Sustainability Alliance) share inspiring insights into SHASA’s work helping Eurobodalla transition to a low-carbon future, improve disaster preparedness, and strengthen community resilience.<br>Hear more about the development of the eight Bushfire and Heat Havens across the Eurobodalla.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kathryn will be outlining the new Eurobodalla Preparedness Guide which will be posted out to households in the Eurobodalla Shire in mid November.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tricia Pye from The Tec Exec will be discussing digital applications ( apps ) that you need to have installed on your devices for emergencies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TheTecExec?__tn__=-]K*F\">The Tec Exec</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/shasa.energy?__tn__=-]K*F\">Southcoast Health &amp; Sustainability Alliance</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>See less</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','U3A disaster Prepardness Presentation','','inherit','closed','closed','','645-revision-v1','','','2025-10-14 12:27:55','2025-10-14 01:27:55','',645,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?p=647',0,'revision','',0),(648,1,'2025-10-14 12:29:00','2025-10-14 01:29:00','','Screen_Shot_2025-10-01_at_4.58.11_pm','','inherit','open','closed','','screen_shot_2025-10-01_at_4-58-11_pm','','','2025-10-14 12:29:00','2025-10-14 01:29:00','',646,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Screen_Shot_2025-10-01_at_4.58.11_pm.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(649,1,'2025-10-14 12:30:57','2025-10-14 01:30:57','<p>The two historic Tilba halls are being lovingly restored to preserve their heritage and transform them into safe, accessible, and vibrant community spaces. Your donation supports essential upgrades and ensures these cherished buildings continue to serve generations to come.</p>','Tilba Halls Main','','publish','open','closed','','tilba-halls-main','','','2025-10-21 12:59:45','2025-10-21 01:59:45','',0,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?campaign=tilba-halls-main',0,'campaign','',0),(650,1,'2025-10-14 12:33:30','2025-10-14 01:33:30','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\'Playdates with Emergency Services\' is returning in 2025, featuring four fantastic free events across the Eurobodalla:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tef/2/16/1f525.png\" alt=\"🔥\"/></fi