7:00pm.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Join your local RFS and other Emergency Services teams for an afternoon of fun, featuring a free BBQ dinner and activities for children.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Playdates with Emergency Services','','inherit','closed','closed','','654-revision-v1','','','2025-10-14 12:34:30','2025-10-14 01:34:30','',654,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?p=658',0,'revision','',0),(659,1,'2025-10-14 12:36:04','2025-10-14 01:36:04','<!-- wp:create-block/campaignblock {\"campaignID\":\"549\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"http://172.19.125.111:8080/?page_id=524\">Help Tilba Out!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.paypal.com/ncp/payment/6YZN6RGUQGSZC\">Become a Member!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Donate 2','','inherit','closed','closed','','590-revision-v1','','','2025-10-14 12:36:04','2025-10-14 01:36:04','',590,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?p=659',0,'revision','',0),(660,1,'2025-10-14 12:36:18','2025-10-14 01:36:18','<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header\",\"theme\":\"twentytwentyfive\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"http://172.19.125.15:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/banner-1024x427.png\",\"id\":163,\"dimRatio\":50,\"customOverlayColor\":\"#7f93b6\",\"isUserOverlayColor\":false,\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.17,\"y\":0.51},\"minHeight\":580,\"minHeightUnit\":\"px\",\"isDark\":false,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"className\":\"no-margin\",\