class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"http://172.19.125.1:8080/?page_id=689\">Achievements &gt;</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/2-4.jpeg\",\"id\":278,\"dimRatio\":50,\"contentPosition\":\"bottom left\",\"style\":{\"color\":[]}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-custom-content-position is-position-bottom-left\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-278\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/2-4.jpeg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"http://172.19.125.1:8080/?page_id=687\">People &gt;</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/2-4.jpeg\",\"id\":278,\"dimRatio\":50,\"contentPosition\":\"bottom left\",\"style\":{\"color\":[]}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-custom-content-position is-position-bottom-left\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-278\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/2-4.jpeg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"left\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"http://172.19.125.1:8080/?page_id=683\">Get Involved ></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"50px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-accent-1-color\">More</mark></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\">SHASA have recently updated our <a href=\"https://shasa.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/SHASA2030-1124s.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">strategic plan</a> to 2030. It outlines our key areas of focus for the next decade and will be regularly reviewed. All feedback welcomed via our <a href=\"https://shasa.com.au/contact/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">contact page</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','About Us','','inherit','closed','closed','','154-revision-v1','','','2025-10-14 13:22:13','2025-10-14 02:22:13','',154,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?p=762',0,'revision','',0),(764,1,'2025-10-14 13:23:04','2025-10-14 02:23:04','<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-accent-1-color\">What Is SHASA</mark></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"left\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left has-medium-font-size\">In 2014 a walk was held in Moruya to highlight climate change. A small group of interested local community members who attended this walk, then formed a group to undertake projects to help achieve a zero carbon Eurobodalla. This group was named Southcoast Health and Sustainability Alliance (SHASA) and was incorporated on the 29th February 2016. SHASA has an Executive of 8 members.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Other community members attend the meetings to participate in projects across the Eurobodalla. All community members are welcomed resulting in a busy group of people attending monthly meetings (held via Zoom) and implementing practical solutions to build community leadership, resilience, and capability to deal with our climate chaos and it’s many impacts including drought, flood, and bushfire.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"50px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"metadata\":{\"name\":\"Featured Category Triple\",\"categories\":[\"featured-selling\"],\"patternName\":\"woocommerce-blocks/featured-category-triple\"},\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"calc( 0.5 * var(\\u002d\\u002dwp\\u002d\\u002dstyle\\u002d\\u002droot\\u002d\\u002dpadding-right, var(\\u002d\\u002dwp\\u002d\\u002dcustom\\u002d\\u002dgap\\u002d\\u002dhorizontal)))\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:calc( 0.5 * var(--wp--style--root--padding-right, var(--wp--custom--gap--horizontal)));padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:0;padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-style-default\"><!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/2-4.jpeg\",\"id\":278,\"dimRatio\":50,\"contentPosition\":\"bottom left\",\"style\":{\"color\":[]}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-custom-content-position is-position-bottom-left\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-278\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/2-4.jpeg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">What We Do &gt;</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/2-4.jpeg\",\"id\":278,\"dimRatio\":50,\"contentPosition\":\"bottom left\",\"style\":{\"color\":[]}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-custom-content-position is-position-bottom-left\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-278\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/2-4.jpeg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"http://172.19.125.1:8080/?page_id=689\">Achievements &gt;</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/2-4.jpeg\",\"id\":278,\"dimRatio\":50,\"contentPosition\":\"bottom left\",\"style\":{\"color\":[]}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-custom-content-position is-position-bottom-left\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-278\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/2-4.jpeg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"http://172.19.125.1:8080/?page_id=687\">People &amp; Governance ></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/2-4.jpeg\",\"id\":278,\"dimRatio\":50,\"contentPosition\":\"bottom left\",\"style\":{\"color\":[]}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-custom-content-position is-position-bottom-left\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-278\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/2-4.jpeg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"left\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"http://172.19.125.1:8080/?page_id=683\">Get Involved ></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:separator -->\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"/>\n<!-- /wp:separator -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"50px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-accent-1-color\">More</mark></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\">SHASA have recently updated our <a href=\"https://shasa.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/SHASA2030-1124s.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">strategic plan</a> to 2030. It outlines our key areas of focus for the next decade and will be regularly reviewed. All feedback welcomed via our <a href=\"https://shasa.com.au/contact/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">contact page</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','About Us','','inherit','closed','closed','','154-revision-v1','','','2025-10-14 13:23:04','2025-10-14 02:23:04','',154,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?p=764',0,'revision','',0),(765,1,'2025-10-14 13:29:18','2025-10-14 02:29:18','','Nicholas Nguyen &ndash; Donate Page','','charitable-pending','closed','closed','','nicholas-nguyen-donate-page','','','2025-10-14 13:29:18','2025-10-14 02:29:18','',0,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?post_type=donation&p=765',0,'donation','',0),(766,1,'2025-10-14 13:30:23','2025-10-14 02:30:23','We had an event yadder yadder.\r\n\r\n[metaslider id=249]','Test event','','publish','closed','closed','','test-event','','','2025-10-14 13:47:37','2025-10-14 02:47:37','',0,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?post_type=em_event&#038;p=766',0,'em_event','',0),(767